WEBVTT

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:24.630
Your dinner is ready, Mr. De Soler.

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:26.750
We have a couple of extras and...

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:27.620
Did it go well?

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:29.250
Perfectly, like all the movies.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.240
Because it's his first production, he's going to hit me.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:32.760
The hit hit me.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.640
Excuse me, old man, I lost my hands.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:41.620
Do you like to film in the street?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:42.830
I prefer in the studio.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:43.690
I didn't ask you.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:45.080
Do you have my rings and the watch?

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.350
And the tie pin, everything in my pocket.

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.000
I'm the secretary model.

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:50.960
I like it more as a secretary than as an actor.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.580
And the public will agree with me.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:53.440
Look, sir.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:54.820
They're waiting for you for take 515.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:55.400
I'm going.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.880
These celebrities of the cinema are just a bunch of people.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.840
Because they tell you the truth.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:01.680
You too.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.900
I told you not to leave the radio, that we are in our element.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.260
About the element.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:09.060
Today, while you were in the audition, two girls came to see you.

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:09.770
And they saw you?

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:10.990
They are waiting for us tomorrow.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:15.120
Tea, canapés, vitrola or porto.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:16.610
Hours from 5 to 6.

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:17.550
Here is the address.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:24.440
This...

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:25.660
Were you waiting for me?

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.960
In the car, two hours ago.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.260
But I see that I arrived on time.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.320
And what is that?

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:29.970
The...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.040
The direction of the pedicure.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:33.430
The pedicure, there are two.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.560
And one for each foot, ma'am.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.680
Shut up! Is this the name of the gentlemen?

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:38.180
Yes.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.080
This one?

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.250
No, I was wrong.

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:44.930
It's the direction of some aunts of mine.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.080
Ah, Sueda.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.540
Silence, they are rehearsing.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.690
In this shot, you should hear even the sigh of the actress.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.410
All right, sir, but I need absolute silence

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.870
because I'm going to take the sound with all the volume it gives.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:58.910
Put it on the microphone.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:03:59.430
All right.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:02.800
Is the microphone ready?

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:04.340
Well, let's go.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.400
Next time you grab one of these, I'll break your face.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.880
You won't be able to do it!

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:11.280
What, no?

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.060
Sound test?

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:17.920
Leave it.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:19.490
It's better if you let go of your nerves.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.090
You always let go of your nerves with me.

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:22.780
Did you pay?

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:24.280
What do you care, you idiot?

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.000
You hit me because I like it. What's wrong?

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.420
I'm asking you if you paid for today's ball.

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.480
It's 50 pesos.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.730
Sign the receipt for me.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.960
Excuse me. Do you have people in the attic?

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:33.310
Come on.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:45.260
Who took the car?

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.720
Leave it. With that money we will have dinner.

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:49.610
Will there be a cellar around here?

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.620
Yes, there is one, but we are not going to go like that, with masks.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.080
The harpy took all the clothes that were in the car.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.230
And mine? Do you want to go get it?

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:57.890
No, I'd rather go naked.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:25.960
At 20, the muscles start to crack.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:29.440
At 30, it becomes sore.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.920
40 is a robbery. I'll give you 50.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:36.120
Put it there.

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:41.450
How many are we? One, two, three, four, five.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:42.710
Six.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.140
Don't argue. We have to put together 50 pesos.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.680
We are five. Five pesos each one.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:51.680
Ten.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:59.980
Don't argue. Five. Five you. Five me. Ten. Five...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:11.380
5-2-5-2-20, 5-2-5-2-30, 5-2-5-2-40, 5-2-5-2-50.

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:13.160
Do the function.

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.830
Thank you very much. I'm going to call the artists.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:22.770
One moment. Where is the money missing?

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:26.460
Go play another piece.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:27.500
At this hour?

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:28.380
Yes, sir.

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:29.410
Don't protest.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:43.810
Blanca, come and help me for a moment.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.100
I'm not going, but Dad, Delia will be awakened.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:51.240
Her little sister won't be awakened, nor the cannons.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.260
He stole 20 pesos from me.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:05.080
You're drunk. Shut up.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.280
You're the drunk one.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.850
I had 30 pesos.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.610
We put 5 each and I have 5.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.520
Who's the drunk one?

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:14.290
Me.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.410
He stole 20 pesos from me.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:29.310
Yes, he did.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.100
You can! You can!

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:38.000
There's the Camorra!

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.890
I am the prologue!

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.170
Respectable audience!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.600
You can talk! No!

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:50.770
And sing! No!

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:53.150
And sing! Yes!

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:59.760
And dance! We want to dance, love!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.700
Yes, sir. As always, without delay,

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:23.020
the fairy comes to order what she has to sing.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:27.090
Don't ask. The public doesn't know what they want.

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:28.170
It's a cult.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:31.860
Do you want me to sing for you, my dear gentleman?

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.900
Make a beautiful country singer and they will be happy.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.210
Do you want me to accompany you?

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:42.010
No! The audience is not an artist.

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.910
More pants!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:14.710
My friends from yesterday, children who sing and know how to dance and sometimes talk about love and sometimes their heart gets rid of so much crying.

00:09:45.228 --> 00:09:51.228
Life moves us like in a waltz, theater of illusion

00:09:51.228 --> 00:09:57.228
The strings of the soul throw us to the compass of a fugitive destiny

00:09:57.292 --> 00:09:59.972
We laugh, we sing, we cry of love.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.620
...behind the happiness.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:05.680
The men are puppets...

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.260
...who handle the fatality.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.960
Puppets don't come from the old world...

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:12.980
...they come from me.

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:54.440
And why are you crying?

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:56.730
They stole my 20 pesos!

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.650
Give me the sandals, you'll forget later.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:06.730
Is it distrust?

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:11.960
No, precaution. But nobody serves here.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:15.660
Cold.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.380
Don't they serve us?

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:19.080
You're the one who sings.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:20.700
I'm the one who serves.

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:21.650
Always.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:22.850
When there's no other choice.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:25.280
And serving gets dirty with such pretty hands.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.520
They're not pretty, but they've never gotten dirty stealing.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:28.740
Why do you say that?

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:29.810
For nothing.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.410
You too, how imprudent.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:35.510
Well, are you going to order or not?

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:37.850
But this young lady has been taken for a whore.

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:40.400
No, the grocery store is fine.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:41.900
They've already passed for novices.

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:43.140
But you don't know the gentleman.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:43.660
Me?

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.240
You don't know me either.

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:46.620
Do me the favor of ordering or I'm leaving.

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.100
Such a bad girl.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.860
And she sings like an angel.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:51.160
Did you like it?

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:51.760
Ask.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:54.750
Give me the list.

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:56.150
If you want, I'll give it to you.

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.020
But at this time there is nothing more than coffee with milk.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:11:59.030
Whatever you want.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:06.680
Thieves, a new profession.

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:07.080
But what?

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:08.040
Follow the current.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:22.740
Be careful.

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:23.340
About what?

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:32.430
Thank you.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:06.200
Good evening.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:21.600
You almost caught us.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:22.610
Thank you.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:23.830
Don't be presumptuous.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.690
I did it for the fame of the place, nothing else.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:26.860
Hey, but you don't...

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:27.160
Don't lie.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:29.580
You know what we are, don't you?

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:30.390
That's right.

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:31.190
But I...

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:32.770
And if he's already realized, confess to him.

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:34.930
In short, he won't tell us.

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:35.770
And what do you know?

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.530
Also, like the Alhajas.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:44.830
Who?

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:49.330
That poor man.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:56.030
Give them back, or I'll pay for it.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:57.090
But they're mine.

00:13:57.470 --> 00:13:59.750
Come on, don't be shameless. Come on, huh?

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:06.940
I'll give it to you? Really?

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.820
But yes, man, yes.

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:14.290
Are you satisfied now?

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:15.900
Now, yes.

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:17.610
Blanca!

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:19.120
Right away, Dad.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.570
And thank you very much.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.180
Did you do everything for the place?

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:26.820
Almost everything.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.410
Well, good night.

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.310
They steal 20 and give me back 50.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:39.090
Mr. Thief, you're a gentleman.

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:49.470
And they call you on the radio.

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.150
They've been looking for you all day.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.080
Now I can't. We have to go to film.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:53.890
I can't go?

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:54.490
No.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.210
Well, the phone.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:57.690
Your servant will take care of it.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.720
Ma'am, I'm secretive.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.760
Uh-huh. Now they call him that?

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:05.220
Look, I can't take it anymore. You look for another secretary and leave me alone.

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.360
When you have another woman, I'll come back.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:07.990
Are you leaving?

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:08.860
Yes, ma'am.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.020
Well, give me this letter.

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:17.910
When are you going to have me in a mask?

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.960
If we just started.

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:23.210
Just? With this, it's already nine nights of serenade.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:26.360
As soon as Elsa finds out that the filming is over, I know who's going to call her.

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.630
But she's not going to find out.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:28.010
Why?

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.380
Because God helps lovers.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:44.140
Why did I have to be here?

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.140
It's not my fault.

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:46.720
I know, it's mine. I interrupted you.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.790
We've been looking for a job so far.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:49.190
At home.

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:50.360
Let's see if they agree.

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:53.680
Yes, we were at home looking for a job in the press.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:56.980
Why don't you stop Mr. Germán?

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:57.920
I don't know why he's here.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:15:59.640
And if he asks you about me?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.730
And if you don't ask me, what do I say?

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:04.270
No.

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:09.020
When will be the day you find a job?

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:09.700
Honored.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.140
And when will we be able to move out of here?

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:12.540
Never.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:14.340
That's called affection.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.720
Go and explain it to dad.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:18.290
I would prefer to explain it to Lala.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:19.390
Don't you like the place?

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:20.730
I love it.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.840
This poor little wall was always the corner of my confidence.

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:25.060
Since it was like this.

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:26.970
And who did you confide in?

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:27.870
The jungle mothers.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.410
They were.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:33.660
He was smoking in the yard, and I was dreaming.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.370
You haven't spoken to them in a long time.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:38.470
Two minutes. When will you arrive?

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.920
May I know what you were telling him?

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:48.660
Yes, sir. That there's a bad man who promises to change his life every day.

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:49.340
And he will.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:54.520
But he didn't do it, and he should learn from me.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.620
That I'm happy with my poverty because it's honorable.

00:16:57.540 --> 00:16:57.960
And selfish.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:16:58.660
No.

00:16:58.890 --> 00:16:59.210
No?

00:16:59.410 --> 00:16:59.630
No.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:03.080
Because I'm happy living for my father and my little sister.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:04.730
And for no one else.

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:20.520
So you think that a gentleman who drinks six cups in half an hour is a drunkard?

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:23.720
Yes, sir. And besides, he's not a gentleman.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:27.730
He isn't? Look, a gentleman knows how to keep secrets.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.520
And if he wasn't...

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.760
I'd tell her that her daughter is in the back of the wall talking to a man.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:37.060
And I won't tell her. Am I or am I not a gentleman?

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:38.740
What did you say?

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:41.880
I didn't say it. I could have said it.

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:46.720
Hey, hey!

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:54.850
Blanca, what are you doing here?

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:55.570
Good evening.

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:58.410
It's not her fault. I'm the one who came...

00:17:58.410 --> 00:17:59.650
I don't ask you anything.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:03.420
A good example for your sister.

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:05.960
Walk inside.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:09.110
No, this man was asking for a job.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.660
Isn't it true that we were talking about a job?

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:15.130
And the job is being asked here by a woman?

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.220
It's that we couldn't ask you.

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:18.540
Why?

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.110
Because it's a substitute.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:22.660
Me? Where?

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:25.410
Inside the theater.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:26.430
Yes, Dad.

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:29.030
Every time the baritone sings, the audience...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.080
The audience doesn't know a thing.

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:33.430
Yes, but it pays.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:36.260
And I was telling your daughter that since she sang something,

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.530
she could be a part of the baritone.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.600
Are you going to replace me?

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:44.530
Me, who has sung all over the world?

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:47.110
Don't make me laugh, sir.

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:51.800
It's not about replacing, it's about having a substitute,

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:53.260
like all the great artists.

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.400
That's something else.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.300
Of course, you could try it, and if it works, eh?

00:18:58.490 --> 00:18:59.190
I don't think so.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.950
Does he sing through music or through hearing?

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.210
He sings out of necessity.

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:12.950
If you only knew that I'm alone

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:17.030
among so many people

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:20.750
If you only knew that I'm sad

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:25.390
while laughing madly

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:29.150
I have everything and it seems to me

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.640
That without you I have nothing

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:37.160
And in the stormy night of my love

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:40.560
I ask you, trembling my voice

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:44.710
Will you ever come to tell me?

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:47.790
Will you come along the path of my loneliness?

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:51.990
I no longer care what people will say

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:56.070
You know humbly, I ask you to come back

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:04.050
Tell me if you will never, never come back

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:07.530
Because I prefer to live from that lie

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:11.630
Than to walk behind the door knowing the truth

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:16.580
Your memory chases me

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:20.360
So tenacious as the sun

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:24.680
And in the lonely night

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:28.420
I hear the wind that names you

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.100
I weigh you in my bitterness

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:36.460
Although no one answers me

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:40.560
And it is useless to protect my resentment

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:43.700
It is stronger than everything

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.040
My love

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:59.420
What did you think?

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:04.180
Frankly, frankly, I don't like it.

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:07.010
You're not going to drink it? But it sings divinely.

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:09.300
Thank you.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.900
I don't know who this lady is, but she's a nice person.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.320
Do you like how I play the piano?

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:13.820
No.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:15.740
My little sister.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:18.870
Dad, be nice. Give these people a job.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.300
Are you satisfied?

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:23.760
I am. And Delia too, right?

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:24.280
Of course.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:26.920
Well, come to the showroom.

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:29.540
And may the art forgive me.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:35.170
Why did you stop studying?

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:36.420
Today, singing.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:37.890
Who is it?

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:40.090
It sounds good.

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:41.560
Do you know him?

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:43.920
I think so.

00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:09.820
What is this about not doing anything?

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:11.620
Naturally, who are we talking about?

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:13.140
Yes, well, yes, what I was saying.

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:15.040
We started wrong.

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:18.800
Your partner has not arrived yet.

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:23.740
Ten minutes, nothing more.

00:22:23.920 --> 00:22:24.790
You told me at seven.

00:22:25.050 --> 00:22:28.610
If he doesn't come, you will do the work of both of you.

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:29.910
All right.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:34.330
And what's that?

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:36.690
A watch.

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:39.700
Where did you get it?

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:40.800
From...

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:43.670
No, it's an honor.

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:45.880
It's a family memory.

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:49.650
It could be from someone else's family.

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:51.280
I'm sure you're mistaken.

00:22:51.740 --> 00:22:53.160
Why do you take me?

00:22:53.320 --> 00:22:54.000
Because of what it is.

00:22:54.840 --> 00:22:56.900
Or rather, because of what it was.

00:22:58.730 --> 00:22:59.970
Dad says it's also...

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.220
Thank you.

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:03.860
What are you doing in the business, Delia? Why aren't you doing your homework?

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:04.520
I finished them.

00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:05.080
And your studies?

00:23:05.300 --> 00:23:07.290
I already studied. Don't you want me to help you?

00:23:08.020 --> 00:23:10.160
There's no need, dear, because the lieutenant is coming.

00:23:10.400 --> 00:23:10.720
Let's go.

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:17.200
I'll be late, I know.

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:19.000
The old man has already protected himself.

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:21.680
And what does it matter to me? I became an artist to get up late.

00:23:22.590 --> 00:23:24.330
Once in the dance, you have to dance, Che.

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:28.620
Yes, you dance and I look at you. This is going to last a short time.

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:29.350
Really?

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.620
I don't say anything, what she's going to say is all Elsa.

00:23:31.820 --> 00:23:32.910
But she's not going to find out?

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:34.670
Of course, since she's already waiting.

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:36.700
What? Who told her?

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:37.980
Me, unintentionally.

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:38.240
How?

00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:42.570
Man, she assured me that you were on two adventures at the same time.

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:44.350
I denied her, she said it was a joke.

00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:47.640
I was indignant, I told her that you didn't have more adventures than one.

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:48.940
I told her everything.

00:23:49.120 --> 00:23:50.760
Of course, without giving her the names.

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:51.220
Yes.

00:23:51.480 --> 00:23:55.400
Look, take your hat and get out of here.

00:23:55.670 --> 00:23:56.770
But I did tell her confidently.

00:23:57.790 --> 00:23:59.980
Besides, she promised me to keep a reserve and she swore to me.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:00.760
I thought he wouldn't follow me.

00:24:01.220 --> 00:24:05.090
You can be sure that he won't come here.

00:24:05.090 --> 00:24:17.750
There he is.

00:24:39.660 --> 00:24:48.440
Ma'am?

00:24:48.700 --> 00:24:50.120
Nothing, just a few gentlemen.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:29.730
A lady has come, who doesn't know what to ask, if she doesn't know what she wants, she wants to be killed, unite, unite, if she doesn't know what she wants, the lady has the money, the bills are a thousand, the assault is a...

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:33.910
I sing, yes, how much I want to run away

00:25:35.280 --> 00:25:36.560
I want to go to the sun

00:25:36.560 --> 00:25:58.360
Listen to me, Mario del Solar doesn't work here

00:25:58.360 --> 00:25:59.690
I don't know that man

00:26:00.280 --> 00:26:01.200
Thank you.

00:26:08.860 --> 00:26:12.550
Well, yes, why work out of time?

00:26:12.820 --> 00:26:13.340
So he could go.

00:26:13.620 --> 00:26:13.880
Who?

00:26:14.690 --> 00:26:15.290
My mother.

00:26:16.150 --> 00:26:17.450
Where was your mother?

00:26:18.290 --> 00:26:20.610
No, Mr. Germán, it's just that we're so hardworking, you know?

00:26:20.730 --> 00:26:22.160
That we're getting out of it.

00:26:22.740 --> 00:26:23.540
I don't understand.

00:26:24.290 --> 00:26:24.990
Neither do I.

00:26:25.720 --> 00:26:27.940
Let's eat and then go to work.

00:26:30.760 --> 00:26:31.240
We'll save ourselves.

00:26:31.920 --> 00:26:34.500
He'll find out anyway. As soon as your first movie comes out, you're done.

00:26:35.010 --> 00:26:36.070
Yeah, well, that's it.

00:26:37.660 --> 00:26:39.700
They're going to be late for dinner too.

00:26:40.100 --> 00:26:42.620
But this old international has her with me.

00:26:42.840 --> 00:26:55.200
Attention. The star of this broadcasting, Mario del Solar,

00:26:55.340 --> 00:26:59.660
has finished his first great Argentine movie, La Ribera.

00:27:00.090 --> 00:27:00.650
See it soon.

00:27:01.060 --> 00:27:04.210
And now, the big news.

00:27:04.750 --> 00:27:08.550
Mario del Solal is ready to start the filming of his second production

00:27:08.550 --> 00:27:10.880
and is looking for his leading lady among the beautiful radio listeners.

00:27:11.900 --> 00:27:13.020
His what?

00:27:13.670 --> 00:27:15.610
Leading lady, the first actress in France.

00:27:15.830 --> 00:27:16.500
In English?

00:27:16.740 --> 00:27:18.150
Are you going to tell me?

00:27:18.410 --> 00:27:20.390
I go in and out of the radio and say everything I...

00:27:22.140 --> 00:27:24.400
What did I say?

00:27:24.680 --> 00:27:29.150
Tomorrow the big selection contest will begin.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:32.680
A good voice and a graceful face are the only requirements.

00:27:33.100 --> 00:27:37.390
The interested parties must present themselves in the Ultra Film Cinematographic Studios

00:27:38.550 --> 00:27:39.890
linked to this broadcasting.

00:27:40.840 --> 00:27:42.220
Let's present ourselves, Blanca.

00:27:42.540 --> 00:27:43.380
Singing, you first.

00:27:43.840 --> 00:27:43.980
Me?

00:27:45.140 --> 00:27:47.200
Let it be.

00:27:47.260 --> 00:27:48.060
What a fantasy.

00:27:48.620 --> 00:27:49.340
What do you mean?

00:27:49.950 --> 00:27:50.970
You're right, Mr. Germán.

00:27:51.090 --> 00:27:52.560
The contests are all the same.

00:27:52.860 --> 00:27:55.180
But this one seems serious.

00:27:55.710 --> 00:27:56.510
This one, like all of them.

00:27:57.060 --> 00:27:58.300
Candidates have been chosen two months ago.

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:00.200
He doesn't know.

00:28:00.520 --> 00:28:02.800
Me? Everyone knows.

00:28:02.900 --> 00:28:03.780
Isn't that right, Miguel?

00:28:04.160 --> 00:28:07.290
Yes, I also knew, but I didn't say it.

00:28:38.670 --> 00:28:40.050
I was asking him to help me.

00:28:40.230 --> 00:28:41.150
To help you?

00:28:41.390 --> 00:28:43.700
Yes, to give me a thank you.

00:28:44.320 --> 00:28:44.840
Can I know?

00:28:45.060 --> 00:28:46.010
No, not now.

00:28:46.550 --> 00:28:48.270
Tomorrow night, when you come, I'll tell you.

00:28:50.350 --> 00:28:51.880
And if I didn't come tomorrow?

00:28:53.350 --> 00:28:56.120
Because you stole again.

00:28:57.540 --> 00:28:57.800
No.

00:28:58.060 --> 00:28:58.980
Can you swear it to me?

00:28:59.120 --> 00:28:59.500
Here?

00:29:00.600 --> 00:29:02.460
Yes. Why so much distrust?

00:29:02.760 --> 00:29:04.480
I would never forgive you for a lie.

00:29:04.660 --> 00:29:06.440
Why did you tell me you wouldn't come tomorrow?

00:29:06.720 --> 00:29:11.220
To tell you. And because sometimes you can cross some impediment.

00:29:11.580 --> 00:29:12.180
A woman.

00:29:12.480 --> 00:29:12.720
No.

00:29:13.660 --> 00:29:14.280
Swear it to me.

00:29:14.340 --> 00:29:17.330
Also? I don't like it.

00:29:17.470 --> 00:29:18.290
Even if you don't like it.

00:29:18.490 --> 00:29:19.850
Is there no other way?

00:29:20.130 --> 00:29:23.110
No. Tell me. I swear. Here.

00:29:24.000 --> 00:29:25.240
I swear.

00:29:25.440 --> 00:29:27.210
I swear.

00:29:27.290 --> 00:29:29.590
That I haven't lied to you or I'll never lie to you.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:33.060
That I haven't lied to you?

00:29:37.780 --> 00:29:38.140
Confessing?

00:29:38.400 --> 00:29:42.270
No, I was making a promise.

00:29:42.570 --> 00:29:43.050
To him?

00:29:43.310 --> 00:29:44.530
No, silly, to the Virgin.

00:29:44.810 --> 00:29:45.070
And you?

00:29:45.310 --> 00:29:47.610
I was looking, to learn how to do it.

00:29:47.790 --> 00:29:48.630
Do I bring you money?

00:29:49.030 --> 00:29:49.310
No.

00:29:49.430 --> 00:29:51.120
Yes, Dad gave me this for you.

00:29:51.480 --> 00:29:51.960
It's little.

00:29:52.220 --> 00:29:54.250
For me it's a lot.

00:29:55.250 --> 00:29:55.910
I hope it's true.

00:29:56.250 --> 00:29:57.870
Come on, it's late.

00:29:58.170 --> 00:29:59.850
Late? What for?

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.100
What? You forgot that tomorrow we have to get up early?

00:30:02.260 --> 00:30:02.560
For what?

00:30:03.260 --> 00:30:04.240
To go to the studio.

00:30:04.360 --> 00:30:04.680
What studio?

00:30:04.920 --> 00:30:05.560
What are you saying?

00:30:05.900 --> 00:30:07.460
Huh? No. What am I saying?

00:30:07.700 --> 00:30:08.700
What studio are you talking about?

00:30:09.120 --> 00:30:13.190
The singing studio. He studies singing and I piano.

00:30:13.740 --> 00:30:17.060
Every day we get up early and we go to study.

00:30:17.600 --> 00:30:19.220
And do you have money to pay the teacher?

00:30:19.620 --> 00:30:22.470
Huh? No. He doesn't, but I give him.

00:30:22.650 --> 00:30:23.830
And who gives you? He?

00:30:24.570 --> 00:30:25.790
Stop joking and let's go.

00:30:26.060 --> 00:30:27.760
When you pretend to be funny, no one can stand you.

00:30:28.020 --> 00:30:28.760
That's what I say.

00:30:28.960 --> 00:30:29.780
See you tomorrow.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:31.680
Good morning, young lady, and thank you.

00:30:31.880 --> 00:30:32.380
Just a moment.

00:30:32.740 --> 00:30:36.130
And I'm missing a ray.

00:30:37.100 --> 00:30:45.570
What are you asking the Virgin?

00:30:46.470 --> 00:30:48.630
Tomorrow I'm going to try something that's crazy.

00:30:49.450 --> 00:30:50.370
Can't you tell me?

00:30:51.760 --> 00:30:53.850
It's required. It's time to go to bed.

00:30:54.610 --> 00:30:55.950
I'm going to keep the dolls, okay?

00:31:26.270 --> 00:31:27.110
Who?

00:31:28.610 --> 00:31:29.540
The boy.

00:31:36.010 --> 00:31:36.850
See you tomorrow, Dad.

00:31:37.110 --> 00:31:38.960
Are you going to sleep?

00:31:40.660 --> 00:31:44.240
No, I'm going to dream.

00:32:01.530 --> 00:32:04.970
Don't forget, tomorrow at the Ultrafilm studios,

00:32:05.320 --> 00:32:10.340
Mario del Solar will choose the woman who will be the future great star of Argentine cinema.

00:32:10.380 --> 00:32:22.180
Are you nervous?

00:32:22.620 --> 00:32:26.340
Imagine if I hadn't had a recommendation for Mario del Solar,

00:32:26.480 --> 00:32:27.700
nor would I have presented myself.

00:32:28.090 --> 00:32:29.910
I think my recommendation is better than...

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:31.460
For Del Solar too?

00:32:31.800 --> 00:32:34.360
For his wife. It's much more efficient.

00:32:34.700 --> 00:32:38.480
What? Mayo Del Solar is married?

00:32:39.040 --> 00:32:40.630
No, but as if he were.

00:32:40.950 --> 00:32:43.130
And the test is right away?

00:32:43.390 --> 00:32:47.320
By shift. A recited scene, and then a test in front of the camera.

00:32:49.340 --> 00:32:52.520
Numbers! Miss, quick! The first three are already giving tests.

00:32:52.680 --> 00:32:55.340
Number 6, number 5...

00:32:55.780 --> 00:32:58.320
What are you doing here?

00:32:58.750 --> 00:32:59.970
Waiting for my number and...

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.200
And you, what are you doing here?

00:33:01.460 --> 00:33:03.720
I'm giving you the number you're waiting for.

00:33:04.410 --> 00:33:07.020
Wait, I'll explain later.

00:33:11.020 --> 00:33:13.180
This nuance that challenges the sky,

00:33:13.180 --> 00:33:15.580
golden iris, snow and grain,

00:33:15.780 --> 00:33:18.480
will be the spark of human life.

00:33:18.620 --> 00:33:21.100
So much is learned in the end of a day.

00:33:21.830 --> 00:33:23.670
The roses bloomed at dawn,

00:33:23.970 --> 00:33:26.360
and to get old they blossomed.

00:33:26.360 --> 00:33:26.780
Mario hasn't come yet.

00:33:27.540 --> 00:33:29.980
We've already announced to the public that he'll be here as soon as his audition is over.

00:33:30.400 --> 00:33:31.860
And you, why aren't you with him?

00:33:31.980 --> 00:33:34.060
Because I won't be a hundred kilometers from here, I say.

00:33:34.280 --> 00:33:38.660
The centuries have passed, hours have passed.

00:33:41.750 --> 00:33:44.630
And now, miss, you will have to repeat this same scene in front of the camera.

00:33:46.200 --> 00:33:46.940
Whenever you want.

00:33:49.120 --> 00:33:51.840
Try not to leave this measure, otherwise you will be out of focus.

00:33:52.000 --> 00:33:52.340
Very well.

00:33:55.920 --> 00:33:58.180
Don't speak loudly, because the sound is distorted.

00:33:58.830 --> 00:33:59.690
Then I will speak slowly.

00:34:00.030 --> 00:34:02.370
Oh, no! Because then the sound doesn't record.

00:34:03.460 --> 00:34:05.060
When speaking, always try to look this way.

00:34:05.270 --> 00:34:06.590
I'm looking both ways.

00:34:06.890 --> 00:34:08.590
It can't be, the light is on this side.

00:34:09.040 --> 00:34:11.960
Don't raise your hands to your face because the color of the makeup is different and it's going to crash.

00:34:12.860 --> 00:34:14.340
Try not to undress when moving your head.

00:34:15.320 --> 00:34:16.440
Be careful when looking at the camera.

00:34:16.620 --> 00:34:19.740
Talk after the blackboard is out.

00:34:20.100 --> 00:34:21.900
And now try to be natural.

00:34:24.660 --> 00:34:27.720
Attention, light, silence, ready, camera.

00:34:32.270 --> 00:34:33.530
The ones that were...

00:34:33.530 --> 00:34:38.440
Cut! What's wrong with you?

00:34:38.520 --> 00:34:41.790
I don't know. With so many things, I forgot to see them.

00:34:43.100 --> 00:34:47.840
I interrupted this test. The next one, number four.

00:34:48.020 --> 00:34:54.440
Over there, miss.

00:34:54.700 --> 00:34:58.510
Mr. Mario del Solar has just arrived at the house.

00:35:00.250 --> 00:35:02.290
...who will immediately join the jury.

00:35:02.550 --> 00:35:19.560
If you don't mind, the next test will be a subject-to-dialogue between you and contestant number 4.

00:35:19.900 --> 00:35:20.180
Good.

00:35:20.400 --> 00:35:26.600
Miss, your test will be with Mr. del Solar.

00:35:27.150 --> 00:35:29.410
Assume that he is your boyfriend and that he tells you that he doesn't want to marry you.

00:35:30.120 --> 00:35:33.280
I'd like you to naturally interpret the feelings that would pass through you.

00:35:33.440 --> 00:35:38.440
Ready for the rehearsal?

00:35:41.180 --> 00:35:43.210
Blanca, forgive me. I'm going to explain...

00:35:43.210 --> 00:35:43.890
What are you going to explain to me?

00:35:43.970 --> 00:35:46.670
How funny it is to make fun of a poor girl because she's humble?

00:35:46.950 --> 00:35:47.670
Please, Blanca.

00:35:47.690 --> 00:35:48.930
Don't be scared. I'm leaving.

00:35:49.300 --> 00:35:50.980
There's no need. Stay here, I'll explain it to you.

00:35:50.980 --> 00:35:52.100
I have nothing to do here.

00:35:52.200 --> 00:35:55.930
Because I didn't bring any recommendations for you or for your wife.

00:35:57.680 --> 00:35:58.080
Fraud!

00:36:08.060 --> 00:36:08.880
What did that woman say?

00:36:09.280 --> 00:36:12.000
Oh, leave me alone. What's wrong with that girl?

00:36:12.220 --> 00:36:13.900
She won't like the cinema.

00:36:14.670 --> 00:36:15.210
What a pity.

00:36:15.620 --> 00:36:17.960
Once I found a natural performer...

00:36:17.960 --> 00:36:21.360
If you hadn't told him, he'd think it was a movie.

00:36:22.280 --> 00:36:23.220
Unfortunately, it's true.

00:36:23.830 --> 00:36:27.090
Mario del Solar singing in Don Germán's little theater in La Boca.

00:36:27.170 --> 00:36:28.630
It should be published in the newspapers.

00:36:29.040 --> 00:36:29.680
I don't understand.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:31.720
I don't know why I came to see this funeral.

00:36:32.160 --> 00:36:35.520
Because you found it funny, like you found Delia.

00:36:35.680 --> 00:36:40.460
Do I keep the food?

00:36:40.680 --> 00:36:42.380
No, you can take out the blankets.

00:36:42.840 --> 00:36:43.520
And if they come later?

00:36:43.820 --> 00:36:44.560
They won't come anymore.

00:36:44.740 --> 00:36:47.590
I don't want a funeral for that. Maybe they'll come to visit.

00:36:47.930 --> 00:36:50.310
They won't come anymore! I don't want them to come anymore!

00:36:50.430 --> 00:36:51.770
Do you understand? I don't want to!

00:36:51.830 --> 00:36:59.980
I don't understand why you took it from me.

00:37:00.500 --> 00:37:04.350
Leave me alone, she'll tell me.

00:37:14.720 --> 00:37:15.200
Blanca?

00:37:15.300 --> 00:37:16.620
She's not here. Why do you want her?

00:37:17.210 --> 00:37:18.730
Someone wants to talk to her.

00:37:19.070 --> 00:37:20.850
Well, it's a coincidence that she doesn't want to talk to anyone.

00:37:21.920 --> 00:37:22.620
Aren't you ashamed?

00:37:23.380 --> 00:37:27.860
Ashamed, ashamed? That word sounds familiar to me, but I don't remember where.

00:37:30.320 --> 00:37:31.920
Do you love him very much?

00:37:32.730 --> 00:37:33.930
Very much, old man.

00:37:34.290 --> 00:37:35.390
And him, do you love him?

00:37:35.510 --> 00:37:40.210
I don't know, but if he loved me, he wouldn't have cheated on me.

00:37:40.990 --> 00:37:42.960
Maybe he regrets it.

00:37:43.520 --> 00:37:46.670
No, dad, because he has another woman.

00:37:47.410 --> 00:37:50.700
Another woman? Then he's a bad man.

00:37:51.380 --> 00:37:54.440
Yes, dad, he came to have fun, nothing else.

00:37:55.200 --> 00:37:59.180
You shouldn't see him again. Never again.

00:38:00.600 --> 00:38:08.840
I swear to the memory of that day that I loved her so much.

00:38:08.840 --> 00:38:11.180
I swear, old man.

00:38:12.970 --> 00:38:14.690
And now don't cry anymore.

00:38:15.480 --> 00:38:15.920
Smile.

00:38:16.520 --> 00:38:27.150
Is Blanca offended with me?

00:38:27.470 --> 00:38:28.390
Not at all.

00:38:28.470 --> 00:38:29.850
You can know why she came to this world.

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:33.200
Don't judge me worse than I deserve. There was no such mockery.

00:38:33.320 --> 00:38:34.560
Why did you go through what wasn't?

00:38:34.780 --> 00:38:36.500
I don't know. The circumstances.

00:38:37.690 --> 00:38:40.600
Besides, if you had known the truth, you wouldn't have trusted me.

00:38:41.210 --> 00:38:43.630
And I didn't care about being away from this house.

00:38:43.770 --> 00:38:43.990
Why?

00:38:45.380 --> 00:38:49.110
Because, even if you don't believe it, here, for the first time in my life, I fell in love.

00:38:49.770 --> 00:38:50.030
No.

00:38:50.210 --> 00:38:54.590
Yes. I understand that now it seems like another lie, but it's true.

00:38:55.040 --> 00:38:56.020
True? True?

00:38:56.880 --> 00:38:59.340
Yes. I don't know if what I did is right or wrong.

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:01.780
But I'm sorry I did it all for a woman.

00:39:02.020 --> 00:39:03.420
A woman?

00:39:03.880 --> 00:39:07.870
A woman who awoke in me honorable feelings that I didn't know.

00:39:08.350 --> 00:39:10.380
And that woman is from here, close?

00:39:14.330 --> 00:39:14.790
Very close.

00:39:15.640 --> 00:39:16.740
Why didn't you tell me before?

00:39:17.750 --> 00:39:22.170
Delia, and you still dare to come here?

00:39:23.070 --> 00:39:23.890
I, Blanca, would like to...

00:39:23.890 --> 00:39:24.370
You've laughed enough.

00:39:25.350 --> 00:39:28.010
I'm sorry, but we can no longer offer you more fun in this house.

00:39:28.310 --> 00:39:28.550
Come on.

00:39:41.900 --> 00:39:47.320
Yes, it's useless. Women and the obelisk are two things you'll never understand.

00:39:47.920 --> 00:39:55.280
Why did you do it that way?

00:39:55.480 --> 00:39:56.560
Does it matter so much to you?

00:39:56.560 --> 00:39:57.800
Yes, it matters a lot to me.

00:39:57.800 --> 00:39:58.480
To you?

00:39:59.000 --> 00:39:59.920
To me, because he...

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:00.320
He wants me.

00:40:01.100 --> 00:40:01.420
He?

00:40:01.790 --> 00:40:02.230
Yes, he.

00:40:02.270 --> 00:40:03.300
He just told me.

00:40:03.420 --> 00:40:04.370
Does it bother you?

00:40:04.660 --> 00:40:04.920
Me?

00:40:06.550 --> 00:40:06.870
No.

00:40:07.030 --> 00:40:29.520
Good night.

00:40:30.160 --> 00:40:32.860
They tell me you don't read the invitations for today's party at your house.

00:40:33.480 --> 00:40:33.860
That's right.

00:40:34.280 --> 00:40:36.060
But damn, you ruin my publicity.

00:40:36.380 --> 00:40:39.980
I've invited a lot of people, authors, journalists, film and theater people.

00:40:40.380 --> 00:40:41.100
What's the reason?

00:40:41.300 --> 00:40:42.600
That I'm not here for parties.

00:40:42.880 --> 00:40:44.630
You were never in a bad mood.

00:40:45.020 --> 00:40:46.280
But I had to think about it before.

00:40:47.030 --> 00:40:48.330
I wasn't in a bad mood before.

00:40:49.200 --> 00:40:50.060
So there's nothing to do?

00:40:50.330 --> 00:40:50.610
Nothing.

00:40:51.090 --> 00:40:51.270
Good.

00:40:51.510 --> 00:40:58.980
You could walk wherever you want.

00:41:04.090 --> 00:41:05.240
And? Did you see Blanca?

00:41:05.420 --> 00:41:06.900
I saw her. She doesn't want to know anything about anything.

00:41:07.060 --> 00:41:07.610
What did she tell you?

00:41:07.770 --> 00:41:09.250
That there were too many messages and the messenger too.

00:41:09.690 --> 00:41:11.350
I got outraged and put things in their place.

00:41:12.160 --> 00:41:12.360
And?

00:41:12.560 --> 00:41:14.910
And what? I did.

00:41:15.110 --> 00:41:17.720
Does it mean that there's nothing to do?

00:41:18.020 --> 00:41:21.040
On the contrary, there's a lot to do and fast, because I already found the solution.

00:41:21.360 --> 00:41:22.730
Will it be like all of them?

00:41:23.790 --> 00:41:25.870
Inevitable. Against suspicion, jealousy.

00:41:26.580 --> 00:41:29.330
Blanca despises you, you have to make her suffer. How? By giving her jealousy.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:33.050
Not with me, because I'm engaged to your crazy sister.

00:41:33.980 --> 00:41:35.720
Delia? What are you saying?

00:41:36.180 --> 00:41:37.220
She confessed it herself.

00:41:37.920 --> 00:41:40.800
So tonight, find a way for Elsa not to go to the party...

00:41:40.800 --> 00:41:42.480
...and invite Delia instead.

00:41:42.950 --> 00:41:43.950
I don't know where I'll find her.

00:41:44.310 --> 00:41:44.530
Here.

00:41:44.830 --> 00:41:45.050
What?

00:41:45.760 --> 00:41:47.650
Here. I mean, she's there.

00:41:47.830 --> 00:41:47.990
Who?

00:41:49.450 --> 00:41:52.820
Delia. She hit me. I had to bring her. She wants to see you.

00:41:54.380 --> 00:41:58.110
I shouldn't receive her. She's a good girl and it would be criminal to make fun of her.

00:41:58.760 --> 00:41:59.440
What a shame.

00:42:00.860 --> 00:42:04.450
I'll tell him to go.

00:42:05.120 --> 00:42:07.460
No. Where is she?

00:42:07.820 --> 00:42:12.140
Come here, there she is.

00:42:12.420 --> 00:42:25.390
How long has it been since you last came home?

00:42:26.020 --> 00:42:26.740
They kicked me out.

00:42:26.760 --> 00:42:27.520
I didn't.

00:42:28.480 --> 00:42:29.240
Blanca knows you came.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:32.360
I wish I could have come. Did I do something wrong?

00:42:33.400 --> 00:42:34.040
You did very well.

00:42:34.200 --> 00:42:56.380
Hey, what's that?

00:42:56.540 --> 00:42:57.880
It's for Delia.

00:43:13.020 --> 00:43:16.920
I'm going. Take them.

00:43:30.060 --> 00:43:30.680
You scared me.

00:43:31.390 --> 00:43:33.210
I came to give you the card that had those flowers.

00:43:33.450 --> 00:43:35.080
You took it out?

00:43:35.280 --> 00:43:36.890
Yes, so that no one would see Dad.

00:43:37.130 --> 00:43:41.910
You were disdaining, weren't you?

00:43:42.240 --> 00:43:43.020
No, on the contrary.

00:43:43.280 --> 00:43:44.750
But it's too late.

00:43:44.890 --> 00:43:46.770
Now you're going to sleep.

00:43:47.170 --> 00:43:48.010
I'm not going to sleep.

00:43:48.410 --> 00:43:52.030
Where are you going?

00:43:52.050 --> 00:43:53.060
Are you interested?

00:43:53.300 --> 00:43:54.420
I've asked you where you're going.

00:43:54.480 --> 00:43:55.580
Who are you to ask me for an account?

00:43:55.740 --> 00:43:56.780
If you want to go out, tell Dad.

00:43:57.060 --> 00:43:57.780
I'm not telling him anything.

00:43:57.920 --> 00:43:58.680
Then I'll tell him.

00:43:58.900 --> 00:43:59.920
And I'm going to tell him the truth.

00:44:00.400 --> 00:44:01.020
What truth?

00:44:01.200 --> 00:44:04.180
The truth. That you're jealous, that you're suspicious,

00:44:04.480 --> 00:44:06.840
that you're poisoned, that I have a boyfriend, that you want to get rid of him.

00:44:07.220 --> 00:44:07.560
Me?

00:44:07.780 --> 00:44:10.080
Yes, you. What do you want to know? Where am I going?

00:44:10.180 --> 00:44:11.310
To see him at his house.

00:44:11.480 --> 00:44:12.380
Why? What's wrong?

00:44:30.890 --> 00:44:31.410
Blanca!

00:44:31.630 --> 00:44:31.970
Coming!

00:44:32.510 --> 00:44:43.190
Are you going to bed?

00:44:43.550 --> 00:44:44.850
No, Dad, not yet.

00:44:45.270 --> 00:44:47.500
Will you help me with the accounts?

00:44:47.900 --> 00:44:48.340
Yes, Dad.

00:44:48.600 --> 00:44:49.400
And Belia?

00:44:49.580 --> 00:44:51.240
She's asleep.

00:44:51.540 --> 00:44:51.920
She's asleep?

00:44:52.310 --> 00:44:58.170
He's not here.

00:44:58.510 --> 00:44:59.970
The rumors...

00:45:00.510 --> 00:45:02.170
He had a good time with me and went to a hotel.

00:45:02.390 --> 00:45:03.250
Are you sure he won't come?

00:45:03.550 --> 00:45:03.790
Yes.

00:45:05.470 --> 00:45:08.830
Miguel convinced her to control me because of the absence and he went to Cordoba for a couple of weeks.

00:45:09.150 --> 00:45:09.950
What's your new problem?

00:45:10.820 --> 00:45:11.460
It's a secret.

00:45:11.820 --> 00:45:12.280
About love?

00:45:12.890 --> 00:45:13.150
Guess.

00:45:13.470 --> 00:45:14.570
Did Miguel come back?

00:45:14.710 --> 00:45:15.490
Not yet, sir.

00:45:16.220 --> 00:45:18.080
He left early to take the tickets to Elsa.

00:45:18.260 --> 00:45:20.170
It's strange that he hasn't come back.

00:45:20.420 --> 00:45:20.840
There he is.

00:45:20.940 --> 00:45:28.860
He did. Everything's ready.

00:45:29.270 --> 00:45:29.570
And Elsa?

00:45:30.190 --> 00:45:32.670
I was sleeping in my bed, on my way to Cordoba.

00:45:32.710 --> 00:45:33.950
Why did you take so long?

00:45:33.990 --> 00:45:37.200
For the other job. I took the envelope with the train tickets to Elsa.

00:45:37.380 --> 00:45:40.270
And then I went to take the invitation to the girls of the Roxy Theatre.

00:45:40.480 --> 00:45:42.480
But it turns out that they had no function or rehearsal.

00:45:42.820 --> 00:45:44.480
I could not fulfill. Here is the invitation.

00:45:44.820 --> 00:45:48.820
What is this?

00:45:49.230 --> 00:45:49.770
What? How?

00:45:54.160 --> 00:45:56.080
And then, what did I tell Elsa?

00:45:56.450 --> 00:45:58.330
The invitation of the girls of the Roxy, idiot.

00:45:59.210 --> 00:45:59.690
The earthquake.

00:46:00.670 --> 00:46:04.700
The cataclysm. And now, I told her you had a film shoot in the Gorbapit,

00:46:04.820 --> 00:46:06.550
and the card said, dear girl.

00:46:08.140 --> 00:46:11.320
Hey, sir, call Mrs. Elsa, I'm going to pick her up at the hotel.

00:46:11.360 --> 00:46:11.880
All right, sir.

00:46:12.340 --> 00:46:14.820
And you, you rascal, take my car and go over there.

00:46:14.980 --> 00:46:18.360
Tell her I'm sick, that I left, I don't know, but don't come.

00:46:18.790 --> 00:46:20.150
Yes, and if I don't find her, what do I tell her?

00:46:20.930 --> 00:46:22.690
That you're the most perfect idiot on earth.

00:46:40.840 --> 00:46:41.620
Mr. Delsolar?

00:46:41.820 --> 00:46:43.680
He just left, but he won't be long.

00:46:44.060 --> 00:46:45.730
Is the young lady invited?

00:46:46.150 --> 00:46:48.590
Yes, I'll wait for her.

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:13.520
Miss, will you wait for someone?

00:47:13.720 --> 00:47:14.760
Yes, sir.

00:47:14.860 --> 00:47:15.120
Mario?

00:47:15.600 --> 00:47:16.360
Yes, sir.

00:47:16.740 --> 00:47:17.660
But he won't wait here.

00:47:30.760 --> 00:47:32.320
Delia! Blanca!

00:47:32.580 --> 00:47:36.830
I think I've made a mistake. If the girls aren't at home, they're going to get fat.

00:47:37.250 --> 00:47:38.370
And why are you going to look for them?

00:47:38.370 --> 00:47:40.220
Because I had to talk to the mucosa.

00:47:40.440 --> 00:47:42.070
La Delia!

00:47:42.270 --> 00:47:43.380
I'm leaving.

00:47:49.150 --> 00:47:51.600
Miguel! Don't go! Come!

00:47:52.290 --> 00:47:57.540
As Mr. Germán said,

00:47:58.000 --> 00:47:59.500
my daughters aren't inside.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:02.920
And you're going to tell me where they are.

00:48:03.260 --> 00:48:04.240
I don't know, Mr. Germán.

00:48:04.360 --> 00:48:05.890
And now I'm not going to carry on with the responsibility.

00:48:06.350 --> 00:48:07.710
Where are my daughters?

00:48:08.170 --> 00:48:10.100
I don't know, Blanca didn't even know about the feet.

00:48:11.370 --> 00:48:13.010
Delia didn't know she didn't have to go.

00:48:13.320 --> 00:48:15.540
And Blanca didn't know either of the two.

00:48:15.640 --> 00:48:16.520
Because Mario...

00:48:16.900 --> 00:48:19.680
Mario, let's go.

00:48:20.000 --> 00:48:21.300
What? Sing?

00:48:22.060 --> 00:48:23.540
I haven't sung yet.

00:48:23.820 --> 00:48:24.900
You want to hire her?

00:48:24.960 --> 00:48:26.260
You're wasting your time, mate.

00:48:26.640 --> 00:48:29.500
It's a pity, because tomorrow I'm going to Italy.

00:48:30.320 --> 00:48:34.240
They've asked me for an Argentinian singer, for a small but important part.

00:48:34.340 --> 00:48:37.340
That means a contract and the necessary studies.

00:48:37.940 --> 00:48:39.460
I'm afraid of him. I'll board alone.

00:48:39.760 --> 00:48:41.080
In view of that, let's dance.

00:48:41.280 --> 00:48:47.540
Who was he?

00:48:47.820 --> 00:48:50.180
A great opera businessman, very unkind.

00:48:50.880 --> 00:48:51.560
Unkind? Why?

00:48:51.800 --> 00:48:53.140
Because he wanted to take you away.

00:48:53.140 --> 00:48:54.060
I don't understand.

00:48:54.300 --> 00:48:56.220
And I want to have you always with me, like this.

00:48:56.400 --> 00:48:57.500
It will take a long time, Mario.

00:48:57.600 --> 00:48:58.620
Don't you remember Mario?

00:48:59.100 --> 00:48:59.820
Leave me alone.

00:49:00.090 --> 00:49:07.250
Leave me, leave me.

00:49:12.040 --> 00:49:16.270
Blanca, get me out of here. You were right, forgive me.

00:49:16.530 --> 00:49:22.760
I'll cover you with this little lady, but don't cry.

00:49:23.080 --> 00:49:25.500
If Dad knew, he'd die of grief.

00:49:25.720 --> 00:49:26.580
He won't know, I promise.

00:49:38.440 --> 00:49:42.940
Dad, don't say anything. It's all my fault.

00:49:43.120 --> 00:49:45.100
She came to see me so you wouldn't find out.

00:49:45.380 --> 00:49:46.270
Is that true?

00:49:46.670 --> 00:49:49.140
Take her home, old man. This isn't the right place for her.

00:49:49.480 --> 00:49:52.620
And you, who had sworn to me.

00:49:52.960 --> 00:49:55.360
I couldn't keep my promise. She was stronger than me.

00:49:55.660 --> 00:49:58.160
Dad, it's useless, Delia. Take her home, dad.

00:49:58.550 --> 00:49:59.170
Yes, let's go.

00:49:59.350 --> 00:49:59.610
I'm staying.

00:50:00.510 --> 00:50:04.190
Turn around? There is nothing to do here. Come on.

00:50:04.230 --> 00:50:05.110
I have to talk to Mario.

00:50:05.720 --> 00:50:10.900
Blanca, you have to choose. That man or your father.

00:50:11.220 --> 00:50:15.510
You, Dad. But let me talk to him. For the last time.

00:50:15.830 --> 00:50:18.080
Enough. What do you say to these people?

00:50:18.220 --> 00:50:20.960
And don't put your feet in my house again.

00:50:21.320 --> 00:50:22.380
It's a noble house.

00:50:47.470 --> 00:50:48.250
Do you want me to go with you to your house?

00:50:48.800 --> 00:50:48.980
No.

00:50:49.060 --> 00:50:49.240
Why?

00:50:50.400 --> 00:50:52.730
I don't have a house anymore.

00:50:52.770 --> 00:50:59.600
I have to talk to Mario.

00:51:00.280 --> 00:51:01.160
Mario loves her a lot.

00:51:02.180 --> 00:51:02.500
And then?

00:51:03.000 --> 00:51:04.160
With half in love.

00:51:05.330 --> 00:51:05.650
Really?

00:51:06.940 --> 00:51:07.160
Really.

00:51:08.730 --> 00:51:13.030
But this is a scandal, a party that the guest does not attend.

00:51:13.150 --> 00:51:15.310
And the secretary making a lady cry?

00:51:15.600 --> 00:51:16.760
He has done that without shame.

00:51:17.000 --> 00:51:17.980
Nothing, on the contrary.

00:51:18.360 --> 00:51:20.400
Then we are going to celebrate it with a glass of champagne.

00:51:20.640 --> 00:51:24.200
No, you shut your mouth. To the health of the unknown beauty.

00:51:24.420 --> 00:51:28.180
Do we have to drink it?

00:51:28.410 --> 00:51:29.970
Drink it, Blanca, if not this will be the gist.

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:30.820
They won't leave her alone.

00:51:31.020 --> 00:51:48.740
I'm joking, miss.

00:51:48.960 --> 00:51:51.500
If you sing like Miguel says, you're my great candidate.

00:51:51.940 --> 00:51:52.540
Look, you're heavy.

00:51:52.820 --> 00:51:54.720
When you get something in your head, you do it right.

00:51:54.840 --> 00:51:55.880
The miss should sing.

00:51:56.300 --> 00:51:57.420
It's an attention she owes us.

00:51:57.990 --> 00:51:59.670
I thought Mr. Payne gave it to us.

00:52:00.830 --> 00:52:02.090
And it seems that they want to charge him.

00:52:02.290 --> 00:52:04.710
For impertinence, we should make her sing to the police.

00:52:04.850 --> 00:52:06.090
Yes, sir. Let's go to the piano.

00:52:06.170 --> 00:52:06.610
To the piano.

00:52:07.050 --> 00:52:08.610
Then, let's dance. Let's dance.

00:52:08.870 --> 00:52:11.470
Leave me, stupid. I don't want to. I don't want to.

00:52:11.550 --> 00:52:23.570
Welcome and congratulations.

00:52:24.090 --> 00:52:25.580
They had told us that there was a divorce.

00:52:25.940 --> 00:52:26.420
You are wrong.

00:52:27.110 --> 00:52:29.710
When Mario gets on his knees and asks for forgiveness...

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:33.940
There's no heart of stone that can resist it, right, darling?

00:52:34.360 --> 00:52:37.340
What are you doing here?

00:52:37.590 --> 00:52:38.670
Help us convince her.

00:52:39.140 --> 00:52:41.840
She doesn't want to sing, or dance, or do anything.

00:52:42.240 --> 00:52:44.050
But now that the owner of the house has arrived,

00:52:44.050 --> 00:52:46.270
and her dear companion, we'll make her sing with all our might.

00:52:46.610 --> 00:52:46.890
Let's go.

00:52:47.060 --> 00:52:47.520
Gold ring.

00:52:47.820 --> 00:52:49.600
Let her be.

00:52:49.680 --> 00:52:51.900
It's possible that they're so drunk that they don't respect

00:52:51.900 --> 00:52:52.760
a woman who's crying.

00:52:53.880 --> 00:52:55.800
I'm not crying.

00:52:56.260 --> 00:52:58.350
I was having a lot of fun.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:03.900
You've made me laugh so much that you thought I was crying.

00:53:04.930 --> 00:53:06.330
I don't want you to force her to sing or anything.

00:53:06.980 --> 00:53:07.580
Come with me, Miguel.

00:53:07.740 --> 00:53:10.460
Who said I'm not going to sing? I'm very happy.

00:53:10.860 --> 00:53:11.760
I like it that way.

00:53:11.760 --> 00:53:13.040
What is it that you're going to make us listen to?

00:53:13.600 --> 00:53:18.270
That, Madre Selva, the Lord knows it.

00:53:19.620 --> 00:53:22.920
It's a story so simple that it seems like a life.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:46.470
My shadow was my companion, of my indescribable beauty,

00:53:46.470 --> 00:53:53.800
my friend was Madre Selva, when, trembling, she opened me,

00:53:53.940 --> 00:53:57.820
with her hope, she kissed my soul.

00:54:02.270 --> 00:54:07.920
Pure and happy, I sang like this, my first confession

00:54:09.680 --> 00:54:12.540
Madreselvas in flower, who saw me born

00:54:12.810 --> 00:54:16.220
And in the old wall, they surprised my love

00:54:17.500 --> 00:54:20.780
Humble caress, is like the affection

00:54:21.170 --> 00:54:24.490
First and dear, I feel for him

00:54:25.270 --> 00:54:28.390
Madreselvas in flower, that climbing they go

00:54:28.390 --> 00:54:29.610
is your hug.

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:32.100
You were born sweet like that

00:54:32.680 --> 00:54:37.080
If every year your flowers are reborn

00:54:37.080 --> 00:54:41.440
It makes my first love not die

00:54:41.440 --> 00:54:47.720
For years and years

00:54:49.170 --> 00:54:54.070
I come to tell you

00:54:54.760 --> 00:54:55.840
My life

00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:06.690
Yes, I pretend to live decently

00:55:07.440 --> 00:55:14.500
That love is a lie, I'm just being true to people

00:55:14.500 --> 00:55:18.320
Today that life has punished me

00:55:18.320 --> 00:55:21.660
And has taught me to suffer to love

00:55:30.280 --> 00:55:42.930
and I tell you like yesterday, mother jungle in flower that they gave me to be born and in the old wall they surprised my love

00:55:42.930 --> 00:55:58.330
the caress is like the caress first and I wanted to never forget, mother jungle in flower that climbing they go, it is your tenacious and sweet hug

00:56:00.250 --> 00:56:01.700
What do you mean?

00:56:27.560 --> 00:56:29.500
You're the artist I needed.

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:32.720
I accept my offer, you are a returner.

00:56:33.300 --> 00:56:33.840
Very well.

00:56:33.980 --> 00:56:36.950
Mario, go on, give this poor girl some money.

00:56:36.950 --> 00:56:37.670
She has earned it.

00:56:37.950 --> 00:56:38.230
Shut up.

00:56:38.530 --> 00:56:39.420
Don't you want to give it to her?

00:56:39.790 --> 00:56:41.250
Very well, I'll give it to her then.

00:56:41.570 --> 00:56:42.330
Enough, enough!

00:56:42.690 --> 00:56:44.700
Come on, I can't take it anymore.

00:56:45.670 --> 00:56:46.110
I can't.

00:56:46.370 --> 00:56:53.500
You've been cruel and stupid.

00:56:53.840 --> 00:56:55.550
You want to fight me again?

00:56:55.550 --> 00:56:57.510
You won't get it, will you?

00:56:57.790 --> 00:56:57.950
No!

00:56:58.230 --> 00:56:59.880
Long live the second moon!

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:00.900
of honey from Mario del Solar.

00:57:01.080 --> 00:57:01.540
Long live!

00:57:07.090 --> 00:57:11.960
That woman is nothing but the past, Blanca.

00:57:12.450 --> 00:57:14.030
I'm to blame for everything. Mario loves her.

00:57:14.590 --> 00:57:15.270
Please, enough.

00:57:15.690 --> 00:57:17.410
I didn't understand a thing about what happened.

00:57:17.950 --> 00:57:18.530
It's very simple.

00:57:19.760 --> 00:57:22.080
I've told so many lies in my life that once I tell the truth,

00:57:22.140 --> 00:57:22.540
no one believes me.

00:57:41.200 --> 00:57:43.180
Delia, what are you doing?

00:57:43.280 --> 00:57:44.740
I was going to open the door. It must be white.

00:57:45.140 --> 00:57:45.880
Come inside.

00:57:46.400 --> 00:57:48.400
Dad, it's my sister.

00:57:48.950 --> 00:57:51.680
No, you don't have any more sisters.

00:57:52.160 --> 00:57:54.350
And I don't have any more daughters.

00:58:04.890 --> 00:58:05.390
Where?

00:58:06.650 --> 00:58:12.000
I don't know, but let's go.

00:58:12.080 --> 00:58:16.400
And now, what will Blanca do?

00:58:16.400 --> 00:58:20.040
I don't know. When did she say that boat was leaving?

00:58:20.180 --> 00:58:20.780
Tomorrow night.

00:58:21.200 --> 00:58:21.920
It's going very far.

00:58:22.080 --> 00:58:23.200
To Europe, I'm going to Milan.

00:58:23.520 --> 00:58:24.630
Do you want to take me, please?

00:58:25.070 --> 00:58:26.170
Miss, I...

00:58:26.170 --> 00:58:26.490
Please.

00:58:31.470 --> 00:58:31.990
Thank you.

01:00:30.668 --> 01:00:32.668
You

01:01:06.490 --> 01:01:07.090
Is it a promise?

01:01:08.200 --> 01:01:08.560
No.

01:01:09.380 --> 01:01:10.340
Then, is it a cult?

01:01:10.600 --> 01:01:12.630
I don't know. Maybe it's a hope.

01:01:13.690 --> 01:01:16.230
The truth is that when there's no happy little branch of Madre Selva,

01:01:16.230 --> 01:01:17.410
the lady doesn't sing quietly.

01:01:17.820 --> 01:01:18.760
Here are the diaries.

01:01:18.920 --> 01:01:19.760
Put them in the drawer.

01:01:19.880 --> 01:01:20.920
Aren't you going to read them, ma'am?

01:01:21.080 --> 01:01:25.230
They all talk about you, about your triumph.

01:01:25.570 --> 01:01:26.320
I don't understand.

01:01:26.840 --> 01:01:29.560
There's something in life, Teresa, that's worth much more than the triumph.

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:31.220
More than money and applause.

01:01:32.550 --> 01:01:36.920
Only that when you get one thing, you lose the other.

01:01:37.650 --> 01:01:38.890
But have you noticed what they say?

01:01:39.150 --> 01:01:56.650
Keep it up.

01:01:57.320 --> 01:01:58.560
I'm fine, really.

01:01:59.220 --> 01:01:59.790
So much.

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:03.780
that after seeing him daily for a year, I'll be happy not to come back.

01:02:04.080 --> 01:02:05.880
He won't come back, Doctor?

01:02:06.100 --> 01:02:09.180
He doesn't need to. The regime will do everything better than me.

01:02:09.400 --> 01:02:10.380
Thank you, Doctor.

01:02:11.360 --> 01:02:17.360
Not for me. First thank him, then his daughter, and later this young friend.

01:02:17.760 --> 01:02:19.580
And I'll have to go, as usual.

01:02:19.760 --> 01:02:20.040
Good afternoon.

01:02:20.360 --> 01:02:27.210
Doctor, you'll have to send us the bill.

01:02:27.570 --> 01:02:29.550
Don't worry, we've already settled it with Mario.

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:30.400
Good afternoon.

01:02:30.560 --> 01:02:30.940
Good afternoon.

01:02:31.060 --> 01:02:31.380
Good afternoon.

01:02:31.680 --> 01:02:34.490
How can I pay you for what you're doing for us?

01:02:35.030 --> 01:02:36.410
Let's not talk about that anymore, okay?

01:02:37.030 --> 01:02:37.350
Delia!

01:02:37.610 --> 01:02:38.350
Come on, she's calling you.

01:02:40.970 --> 01:02:42.210
Who's seen you and who's seen you?

01:02:42.310 --> 01:02:46.980
If two years ago they had told me you were going to waste your days taking care of sick people and miserable families,

01:02:47.100 --> 01:02:48.260
I would have laughed to death.

01:02:48.520 --> 01:02:49.160
Shall we start?

01:02:49.340 --> 01:02:51.220
And all to get you involved in honest passions.

01:02:51.300 --> 01:02:53.580
Have you changed your life? Have you become a dreamer?

01:02:53.720 --> 01:02:56.110
Do you remember those nocturnal pindings?

01:02:56.150 --> 01:02:56.870
I do.

01:02:57.150 --> 01:02:58.330
Do you remember Elsa's puppets?

01:02:58.890 --> 01:02:59.210
I do.

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:02.260
Do you remember the 10 pesos I lent you yesterday and you haven't returned them to me?

01:03:02.300 --> 01:03:02.860
I don't remember.

01:03:11.640 --> 01:03:21.260
What does he say?

01:03:21.790 --> 01:03:23.670
He's dreaming about Blanca, as usual.

01:03:24.450 --> 01:03:25.190
Has he had any news?

01:03:25.850 --> 01:03:26.170
None.

01:03:26.770 --> 01:03:29.250
After those four letters that Dad returned without opening them,

01:03:29.310 --> 01:03:29.890
there's never been another one.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:33.110
She didn't have any temptations. I would have opened her up.

01:03:33.170 --> 01:03:37.200
She couldn't. I promised Dad that I would never open a letter to Blanca.

01:03:37.280 --> 01:03:39.260
What would have happened to her?

01:04:22.010 --> 01:04:23.820
I'll do it as soon as possible, then you'll have to get married.

01:04:24.260 --> 01:04:24.400
Of course.

01:04:24.660 --> 01:04:26.890
Is it true that you started singing in this city?

01:04:27.050 --> 01:04:29.840
Yes, in a theater of puppets, and I was very proud.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:32.500
Gloria Selva, is that your real name?

01:04:32.760 --> 01:04:33.260
No, no.

01:04:33.420 --> 01:04:34.660
And why did you choose that name?

01:04:35.450 --> 01:04:38.820
Selva, because I took the last two syllables of Mother Selva,

01:04:38.880 --> 01:04:39.840
my favorite flower.

01:04:40.100 --> 01:04:40.780
And Gloria?

01:04:41.840 --> 01:04:43.980
Because it's what every artist longs for.

01:04:44.250 --> 01:04:47.530
Very good. Do you have family in Buenos Aires?

01:04:47.730 --> 01:04:50.410
I had, now I don't know.

01:04:50.890 --> 01:04:51.590
When are you debuting?

01:04:52.080 --> 01:04:54.270
Tomorrow, because the ship has arrived late.

01:04:54.730 --> 01:04:56.270
Tonight we are doing a general rehearsal.

01:04:56.900 --> 01:04:59.700
So, get up from the uncommunication and I'll wait for you tomorrow.

01:05:00.480 --> 01:05:02.260
Thank you. Good luck.

01:05:02.380 --> 01:05:02.880
Thank you.

01:05:02.880 --> 01:05:11.860
Gentlemen, the show is about to start.

01:05:12.080 --> 01:05:13.510
The diva has to leave you.

01:05:13.750 --> 01:05:15.310
So good luck and good luck.

01:05:15.590 --> 01:05:15.890
Thank you, thank you.

01:05:15.890 --> 01:05:16.230
I'll say the same.

01:05:16.670 --> 01:05:16.970
I hope so.

01:05:17.170 --> 01:05:17.730
See you later.

01:05:17.810 --> 01:05:18.430
See you later. Good night.

01:05:22.960 --> 01:05:24.920
I've never had so much nerve on a debut.

01:05:25.320 --> 01:05:26.080
Completely useless.

01:05:26.440 --> 01:05:29.870
The success is so sure that we have prepared a reception for you after the show.

01:05:30.030 --> 01:05:31.170
See you later.

01:05:31.170 --> 01:05:31.510
See you later.

01:05:31.630 --> 01:05:36.840
The theater is on fire, there's no room for more people.

01:05:37.680 --> 01:05:38.760
Don't you hear me, ma'am?

01:05:38.840 --> 01:05:39.360
I hear you.

01:05:40.080 --> 01:05:42.060
You can't expect more satisfactions in a debut.

01:05:43.090 --> 01:05:45.260
What's the point of all that if it's not him?

01:05:45.460 --> 01:05:47.080
Him, always him.

01:05:47.650 --> 01:05:48.650
When will we forget him?

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:31.720
When I saw the picture, I couldn't believe it.

01:06:33.010 --> 01:06:53.290
What for?

01:06:53.610 --> 01:06:54.250
To see it.

01:06:54.470 --> 01:06:55.450
Don't you see it from here?

01:07:54.850 --> 01:07:57.210
I came in where I wanted. Didn't I get you the stage?

01:07:57.450 --> 01:07:57.710
It's true.

01:07:58.010 --> 01:07:59.390
They know me a lot here. You'll see.

01:08:00.440 --> 01:08:00.820
Goodbye, Doctor.

01:08:01.040 --> 01:08:02.480
Who is it?

01:08:02.480 --> 01:08:03.010
I don't know.

01:08:03.190 --> 01:08:04.020
Why don't you say hello?

01:08:04.220 --> 01:08:05.200
To see if he answers me.

01:08:05.300 --> 01:08:10.280
The gentlemen?

01:08:10.520 --> 01:08:11.240
They come with me.

01:08:11.440 --> 01:08:12.040
And who are you?

01:08:12.060 --> 01:08:12.790
Don't you know me?

01:08:12.930 --> 01:08:13.750
Miguel Salvatierra.

01:08:13.850 --> 01:08:14.350
I don't know you.

01:08:14.510 --> 01:08:15.730
You can't come in.

01:08:17.100 --> 01:08:17.460
Blanca!

01:08:19.330 --> 01:08:19.690
Elia!

01:08:20.920 --> 01:08:22.200
Here, my dear.

01:08:22.820 --> 01:08:23.180
Blanca!

01:08:24.240 --> 01:08:25.600
Come in.

01:08:25.720 --> 01:08:27.130
Excuse me.

01:08:31.820 --> 01:08:33.910
I see him and I can't believe it. How is he, Dad?

01:08:34.130 --> 01:08:34.610
He didn't come?

01:08:34.830 --> 01:08:37.030
No, he was very sick, but he's fine now.

01:08:37.230 --> 01:08:38.550
As soon as I got off the boat, I went home.

01:08:38.810 --> 01:08:41.280
I came to the corner, but I didn't dare to go in.

01:08:41.440 --> 01:08:43.730
When can I go and see him?

01:08:44.020 --> 01:08:46.200
You know how stubborn he is, but he's very good.

01:08:46.400 --> 01:08:47.760
We'll go get him ready and you'll see him soon.

01:08:48.630 --> 01:08:51.670
And you, how tall you are. A real lady.

01:08:52.270 --> 01:08:54.930
In a few days, ma'am. I'll get married next week.

01:08:55.310 --> 01:08:57.560
No, I can pretend to be my boyfriend.

01:08:57.740 --> 01:08:58.480
Do you want to meet him?

01:08:58.600 --> 01:08:58.800
Of course.

01:09:10.330 --> 01:09:10.650
Here it is.

01:09:10.770 --> 01:09:24.130
I'm happy for your triumph, Blanca.

01:09:24.520 --> 01:09:25.040
Thank you.

01:09:25.060 --> 01:09:27.750
I was just about to tell Delia that...

01:09:28.000 --> 01:09:29.950
...he's getting married to Tron.

01:09:30.960 --> 01:09:32.120
You would never have believed me, would you?

01:09:32.240 --> 01:09:33.060
And why not?

01:09:33.340 --> 01:09:37.780
I wish you all kinds of happiness.

01:09:40.120 --> 01:09:40.920
Won't you give me a kiss?

01:09:41.600 --> 01:09:41.860
Yes.

01:09:41.960 --> 01:09:48.140
Excuse me, but the second act is about to begin.

01:09:48.740 --> 01:09:50.120
We can meet tomorrow.

01:09:50.220 --> 01:09:51.410
Good night.

01:09:51.860 --> 01:09:52.060
Goodbye.

01:10:08.920 --> 01:10:11.880
Hello, how are you? I didn't want to let you in, but I did.

01:10:11.900 --> 01:10:13.070
This is a triumph.

01:10:13.340 --> 01:10:16.160
She's not happy, but she's not happy to see me.

01:10:17.860 --> 01:10:20.760
And that? Have you done something to her?

01:10:21.260 --> 01:10:22.660
Nothing, it must be the excitement.

01:10:22.880 --> 01:10:23.400
The excitement of what?

01:10:23.760 --> 01:10:24.760
Of seeing me.

01:10:25.040 --> 01:10:27.820
Do me a favor, what's on your mind?

01:10:28.060 --> 01:10:28.320
Nothing.

01:10:29.140 --> 01:10:29.840
This is not a separation.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:33.580
Just Gloria, the success function, then the party, everything is ready.

01:10:34.040 --> 01:10:34.540
I'm not going.

01:10:34.800 --> 01:10:35.060
What?

01:10:35.760 --> 01:10:36.420
I'm not going.

01:10:37.060 --> 01:10:40.400
Now that I invited everyone and we had prepared a surprise for you.

01:10:40.460 --> 01:10:42.260
Don't insist, I'm not going to the party.

01:10:42.710 --> 01:10:43.690
Rio, what a disaster.

01:10:44.260 --> 01:10:45.180
I'm going to suspend everything.

01:10:46.330 --> 01:10:48.730
Mrs. Selva, in ten minutes I'll start the second.

01:10:49.840 --> 01:10:50.140
I'm going.

01:10:50.320 --> 01:10:57.600
And what are you doing there?

01:10:57.830 --> 01:10:58.390
I'm thinking.

01:10:58.750 --> 01:10:59.150
On what?

01:10:59.590 --> 01:10:59.870
On what?

01:10:59.870 --> 01:10:59.970
and

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:02.840
It's the first time in my life that I've made a woman cry so much.

01:11:02.840 --> 01:11:10.910
Take her home. I have something urgent to do.

01:11:11.090 --> 01:11:11.960
See you tomorrow.

01:11:12.120 --> 01:11:12.500
See you tomorrow.

01:11:40.200 --> 01:11:42.710
Why are you here? To congratulate him again?

01:11:48.740 --> 01:11:51.780
No, Blanca. I came to tell you what I couldn't in front of that creature.

01:11:52.020 --> 01:11:56.540
You have nothing to tell me. Don't forget that creature is going to be your wife.

01:11:57.520 --> 01:11:59.370
No. I can't marry her anymore.

01:12:00.030 --> 01:12:01.170
And since when did you change your mind?

01:12:01.450 --> 01:12:03.510
Since this night, since the moment I saw you again.

01:12:03.650 --> 01:12:07.870
Very romantic, but it doesn't convince.

01:12:08.300 --> 01:12:09.040
Don't make fun of me.

01:12:09.250 --> 01:12:10.610
How can I not understand you?

01:12:11.080 --> 01:12:12.000
You should understand me.

01:12:12.120 --> 01:12:15.360
We became very companions with the old man's illness.

01:12:15.960 --> 01:12:19.420
Then things came as they came, I don't know.

01:12:20.690 --> 01:12:21.730
There's nothing left to do.

01:12:23.500 --> 01:12:25.160
Yes, Blanca, we're on time.

01:12:25.660 --> 01:12:27.380
We can be happy, far away from here is needed.

01:12:27.780 --> 01:12:28.140
And her?

01:12:28.580 --> 01:12:29.800
She will know the truth this same night.

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:30.900
He'll know how to understand me.

01:12:30.920 --> 01:12:32.260
What if he doesn't understand you?

01:12:32.520 --> 01:12:34.180
He's very young, and at his age, all the wounds hurt.

01:12:34.660 --> 01:12:36.920
Am I inopportune?

01:12:38.280 --> 01:12:40.230
No. Good night.

01:12:40.610 --> 01:12:43.320
Good night.

01:12:46.770 --> 01:12:48.410
I've ordered to suspend the reception.

01:12:48.810 --> 01:12:50.090
Very badly done, because I intend to leave.

01:12:50.190 --> 01:12:51.010
But why didn't you tell me?

01:12:51.350 --> 01:12:53.270
I don't care what I told you, I need to see people,

01:12:53.310 --> 01:12:54.430
to rejoice, to drink if necessary.

01:12:54.810 --> 01:12:56.290
Then I'll run to suspend the suspension.

01:12:56.550 --> 01:12:57.710
And poor you, if I don't have fun.

01:13:01.560 --> 01:13:02.560
The dance-blue dress.

01:13:02.880 --> 01:13:04.140
What's wrong, ma'am?

01:13:04.380 --> 01:13:07.990
Nothing. They say that sadness takes happiness away.

01:13:08.010 --> 01:13:10.710
And I don't want to be sad tonight.

01:13:48.270 --> 01:13:51.510
I'm delighted, and as I promised, I'm ready to have fun.

01:13:51.750 --> 01:13:53.040
Don't you dance?

01:13:53.500 --> 01:13:56.920
Later. The first number is the surprise I announced to you.

01:13:57.060 --> 01:13:59.970
I'm sick of curiosity. I want to know immediately...

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:00.860
What is it exactly about?

01:14:00.960 --> 01:14:01.620
Come right away.

01:14:02.100 --> 01:14:16.810
We'll have a regular function.

01:14:16.810 --> 01:14:17.520
Do you like it?

01:14:18.010 --> 01:14:19.570
I couldn't have had a better idea.

01:14:20.620 --> 01:14:21.380
Who was it about?

01:14:21.960 --> 01:14:22.660
Who was it about?

01:14:22.740 --> 01:14:22.980
Mine.

01:14:23.300 --> 01:14:26.130
You told me that your beginnings had been in a puppet theater

01:14:26.130 --> 01:14:28.030
and we thought that this idea was going to make it.

01:14:28.400 --> 01:14:29.000
Have you been well?

01:14:29.200 --> 01:14:29.780
Very well.

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:31.240
Is something wrong, Gloria?

01:14:31.560 --> 01:14:32.380
No, nothing.

01:14:32.880 --> 01:14:34.680
However, she thinks something is wrong.

01:14:35.100 --> 01:14:38.900
Just memories. Who's going to handle those dolls?

01:14:39.140 --> 01:14:39.840
A real artist.

01:14:40.570 --> 01:14:42.550
It's not hard to convince him because he's retired

01:14:42.550 --> 01:14:44.460
and his family won't let him work.

01:14:44.820 --> 01:14:46.890
I have to meet him. What's his name?

01:14:47.010 --> 01:14:48.690
I don't know. Don't worry about that.

01:14:50.890 --> 01:14:52.710
If you're late, excuse me, sir.

01:14:53.030 --> 01:14:55.210
I wanted to wait for my daughter to go to bed.

01:14:55.430 --> 01:14:57.340
I wouldn't have let you go.

01:14:57.540 --> 01:14:58.960
They're all waiting there.

01:14:59.380 --> 01:14:59.980
There's a lot of...

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:19.960
There's a lot of people, full of people. Look at that.

01:15:20.620 --> 01:15:21.280
Who's that?

01:15:21.360 --> 01:15:22.740
That lady that everyone's around.

01:15:23.240 --> 01:15:26.940
That's Gloria Selva, the great singer for whom you're going to work.

01:15:28.400 --> 01:15:28.920
Gloria who?

01:15:30.000 --> 01:15:33.500
The jungle, the jungle of glory. Are you sick?

01:15:34.200 --> 01:15:39.290
Yes, a little. I'd like to go home.

01:15:40.150 --> 01:15:41.460
No, you're not going.

01:15:41.740 --> 01:15:44.400
We'll pay you twice as much, but you're not going.

01:15:44.660 --> 01:15:45.640
But, sir...

01:15:45.640 --> 01:15:47.060
No, sir, it's not worth it.

01:15:47.180 --> 01:15:49.660
How am I going to look bad? Tell the master to start.

01:15:51.030 --> 01:15:52.010
Gentlemen, the function is about to begin.

01:16:00.510 --> 01:16:18.100
Don't move, they're dolls.

01:16:18.570 --> 01:16:19.870
I don't know, I already told you before.

01:16:20.090 --> 01:16:21.130
I need to see him immediately.

01:16:21.530 --> 01:16:22.910
When he's finished, don't call his attention.

01:16:25.570 --> 01:16:29.220
Goodbye, my beautiful.

01:16:30.280 --> 01:16:58.000
I'm old and I sing very badly, but you'll have to forgive me because the fairy who sang well, I don't have her anymore, and I, and I pray.

01:17:02.110 --> 01:17:02.390
Dad!

01:17:05.250 --> 01:17:07.600
Gentlemen, a doctor, please.

01:17:07.740 --> 01:17:09.370
Doctor, an attack.

01:17:11.650 --> 01:17:14.030
Dad, talk. What's wrong?

01:17:15.180 --> 01:17:19.740
It's nothing. The machine is working.

01:17:21.500 --> 01:17:25.990
Take me home, please. Take me home.

01:17:31.880 --> 01:17:35.380
And now, go to bed. This is not a place for a sick man, Dad.

01:17:35.730 --> 01:17:37.810
Don't leave me here, please.

01:17:38.830 --> 01:17:44.340
I'm not sick. I'm alive.

01:17:46.700 --> 01:17:51.550
It's not the same, and it's the same.

01:17:53.710 --> 01:17:54.670
Can we leave him, Doctor?

01:17:54.950 --> 01:17:56.230
Yes, he prefers it.

01:17:56.820 --> 01:17:58.080
Forgive me.

01:17:58.360 --> 01:17:59.810
What do I have to forgive you?

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:02.460
I had a grudge against him.

01:18:02.820 --> 01:18:02.960
Why?

01:18:03.360 --> 01:18:04.980
I'm going to tell you.

01:18:05.120 --> 01:18:08.700
He says that since you left, his eunuchs didn't sing anymore.

01:18:10.780 --> 01:18:12.160
Now they'll do it again, Papa.

01:18:13.640 --> 01:18:17.740
I'll stay here so that they can sing whatever you want.

01:18:18.340 --> 01:18:24.610
No. Now my Bianca is the glory of the jungle.

01:18:25.820 --> 01:18:26.360
Great.

01:18:30.060 --> 01:18:33.200
My dolls are too little for her.

01:18:37.500 --> 01:18:38.800
Don't you want me to keep them?

01:18:39.450 --> 01:18:41.110
I would love them so much.

01:18:41.370 --> 01:18:44.200
Do you remember the fairy?

01:18:45.170 --> 01:18:51.760
Yes, I remember what they said, what they sang.

01:19:21.340 --> 01:19:29.800
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:37.070
My friends from yesterday, dolls that sing and know how to dance

01:19:37.070 --> 01:19:39.710
And sometimes they talk about love

01:19:40.360 --> 01:19:44.730
And sometimes their hearts...

01:19:45.800 --> 01:19:47.240
Doctor! Doctor!

01:19:47.560 --> 01:19:54.330
He has...

01:19:54.330 --> 01:19:55.460
A little water, quickly.

01:19:56.280 --> 01:19:56.680
It's something serious.

01:19:58.740 --> 01:19:59.460
Nothing, it's nothing.

01:20:03.290 --> 01:20:04.030
Thank you.

01:20:04.220 --> 01:20:04.840
Don't talk, Dad.

01:20:05.120 --> 01:20:06.060
Get some rest.

01:20:07.700 --> 01:20:17.200
Now that my children are living again, I don't care.

01:20:19.750 --> 01:20:20.710
But what are you saying, Dad?

01:20:21.170 --> 01:20:22.630
You're going to live many more years.

01:20:23.270 --> 01:20:24.370
Right, Doctor?

01:20:24.770 --> 01:20:29.080
He says yes.

01:20:30.440 --> 01:20:39.290
I know I won't, to be at peace, promise me that you'll take care of Delia.

01:20:39.390 --> 01:20:51.660
If I leave and she stays alone, who will worry about her happiness?

01:20:55.850 --> 01:20:56.530
I promise.

01:21:00.000 --> 01:21:00.660
Yes.

01:21:18.820 --> 01:21:26.580
Don't cry, give me your hand and I'll take care of you.

01:21:26.760 --> 01:21:28.970
I love you.

01:21:30.252 --> 01:21:32.252
dispedir me

01:22:00.640 --> 01:22:09.680
Hala is beautiful, and so is Luceo.

01:22:39.240 --> 01:22:39.440
We're here?

01:22:39.720 --> 01:22:39.900
Yes.

01:22:42.280 --> 01:22:42.880
Don't come in.

01:22:43.220 --> 01:22:43.300
Why?

01:22:43.560 --> 01:22:44.730
Do I have to talk to Delia?

01:22:44.870 --> 01:22:45.430
You don't have to.

01:22:45.750 --> 01:22:46.390
But how?

01:22:46.740 --> 01:22:47.040
What about us?

01:22:47.280 --> 01:22:48.100
It can't be.

01:22:48.480 --> 01:22:49.590
I can't talk now.

01:22:49.770 --> 01:22:50.130
Go away.

01:22:50.270 --> 01:22:51.240
And your promises today?

01:22:51.380 --> 01:22:52.200
I didn't promise you anything.

01:22:52.650 --> 01:22:53.390
But you listened to me.

01:22:53.410 --> 01:22:54.910
And I thought your silence...

01:22:54.910 --> 01:22:56.150
I kept quiet so as not to offend you.

01:22:56.390 --> 01:22:58.630
I swear I don't understand this joke.

01:22:58.810 --> 01:22:58.990
No joke.

01:23:00.410 --> 01:23:03.300
You should understand that I'm giving up my career and...

01:23:03.300 --> 01:23:06.370
Your career? Now I'm nothing for your pride.

01:23:06.510 --> 01:23:08.860
No, but I need my freedom.

01:23:09.940 --> 01:23:12.100
And because of you I felt capable of even a bad deed.

01:23:12.300 --> 01:23:18.200
How stupid I must seem to you, if I even thought you loved me like before.

01:23:21.350 --> 01:23:24.690
One makes mistakes sometimes, forgive me.

01:23:25.430 --> 01:23:27.750
I can't now, maybe when I despise you less.

01:23:28.030 --> 01:23:28.210
No.

01:23:28.430 --> 01:23:29.520
You'll be proud, right?

01:23:30.090 --> 01:23:32.370
You got away with the mess your ex-admirer made you.

01:23:32.450 --> 01:23:33.090
Enough, please.

01:23:33.800 --> 01:23:37.180
And I, who was going to betray an innocent creature for a...

01:23:37.180 --> 01:23:39.570
No, don't insult me, Mario.

01:23:39.710 --> 01:23:42.070
I'm a bad woman, I've cheated on you, I've never loved you.

01:23:42.430 --> 01:23:43.430
Everything I want.

01:23:43.670 --> 01:23:47.560
But God is witness that I'm worthy of respect.

01:23:50.440 --> 01:23:50.840
Delia!

01:23:50.960 --> 01:23:51.790
What are you going to do?

01:23:51.970 --> 01:23:52.290
Nothing.

01:23:52.530 --> 01:23:59.970
And your boyfriend found out about Dad and came to...

01:24:00.660 --> 01:24:03.460
Thank you, Mario. That's very kind of you.

01:24:03.830 --> 01:24:06.670
Yes, he's very kind and he loves you very much.

01:24:07.340 --> 01:24:11.910
You too will have to love him as much as he deserves...

01:24:15.810 --> 01:24:17.030
...so that you can be very happy.

01:24:25.400 --> 01:24:27.370
I have to give the old man some good news...

01:24:28.010 --> 01:24:29.710
...so that he can leave in peace.

01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:32.680
He won't be able to hear her anymore.

01:25:30.410 --> 01:25:32.420
A song of love

01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:00.320
See you next time.

01:27:04.120 --> 01:27:05.840
For the one who forgets you

01:27:30.190 --> 01:27:30.550
Mm-hmm.
